{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to the world of motorsport and RENNSPORT!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive different car classes like <strong>GT3</strong>, <strong>GT4</strong>, <strong>Hypercars</strong>, and more in both single-class and multi-class races.\u00a0Explore the world of racing at iconic locations like <strong>Autodromo Nazionale Monza</strong>, <strong>Circuit de Spa-Francorchamps</strong>, and <strong>Daytona International Speedway</strong>, among others.\u00a0Drive against other players of matching skill in multiplayer races or rise through the ranks in league racing.\u00a0Show the world your skills by dominating the leaderboards in Time Trials, or challenge your friends directly with any car and track combination you can think of.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > RENNSPORT is available in two editions:\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/c027442fee24c29020124dfdc5fdb50e.avif?t=1771068564\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>STANDARD EDITION </strong>offers the core RENNSPORT experience with a broad lineup of cars and tracks to get you started on your digital motorsport journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cars</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BMW M Hybrid V8</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Porsche 963</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mercedes-AMG GT3 2020</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Porsche 911 GT3 R (992)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BMW M4 GT3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audi R8 LMS GT3 evo II</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aston Martin Vantage GT3</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >McLaren 720S GT3-Evo 2023</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Porsche 911 GT3 R EVO</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audi R8 LMS GT4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BMW M4 GT4</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Porsche 911 GT3 Cup</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audi RS 3 LMS 2022</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hyundai Elantra N TCR</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Porsche Mission R</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Praga R1</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tracks</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hockenheimring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >N\u00fcrburgring GP</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circuit de Spa Francorchamps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Autodromo Nazionale Monza</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8eta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daytona International Speedway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Michelin Raceway Road Atlanta</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orchard Road Street Circuit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Goodwood Hillclimb</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fuji International Speedway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jeddah Corniche Circuit</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crest Da Cauras</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2077750/extras/31060ceefa77a22f4c5a8f66022c55ee.avif?t=1771068564\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>DELUXE EDITION </strong>is the most complete version of RENNSPORT and includes everything in the <strong>STANDARD EDITION</strong>, and also:  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Porsche 911 GT3 R rennsport</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Nordschleife Pack</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two upcoming DLC p